⍝ Bugs38_Workspace.tc
⍝ ----------------------------------
⍝ Blake McBride's Bugs38 items that )SAVE, )DUMP, or )COPY workspaces.
⍝ The workspaces are written into the testcase library root
⍝ (testcases/libroot) and dropped at the end.






      ⍝ Bugs38 #20: )COPY_ONCE identifies a workspace by its full file name, so
      ⍝ workspaces with the same name in different directories are different





      )CLEAR
CLEAR WS




      A38←'from 0'





      )SAVE B38_CO
³




      )CLEAR
CLEAR WS




      B38←'from 1'





      )SAVE 1 B38_CO
³




      )CLEAR
CLEAR WS




      )COPY_ONCE ./testcases/libroot/workspaces/B38_CO
NEW )COPY_ONCE workspace: ./testcases/libroot/workspaces/B38_CO
SAVED ³



      )COPY_ONCE ./testcases/libroot/wslib1/B38_CO
NEW )COPY_ONCE workspace: ./testcases/libroot/wslib1/B38_CO
SAVED ³



      )COPY_ONCE ./testcases/libroot/workspaces/B38_CO.xml





      )VARS
A38     B38




      )DROP B38_CO
³




      )DROP 1 B38_CO
³





      (⊂'garbage') ⎕FIO[56] 'testcases/libroot/workspaces/B38_BAD.xml'
8




      )COPY_ONCE B38_BAD
NEW )COPY_ONCE workspace: B38_BAD




      )COPY_ONCE B38_BAD
NEW )COPY_ONCE workspace: B38_BAD




      ⎕FIO[19] 'testcases/libroot/workspaces/B38_BAD.xml'
0





